# Extra macOS packages for Intel Macs only.
#
# Homebrew dropped support for macOS on Intel in September 2026: there are no
# x86_64 bottles any more, so every formula here is compiled from source. Add
# things only when the build time is worth it.
#
# Deliberately absent, and available in Brewfile.arm64 instead:
#
#   curl   macOS ships its own at /usr/bin/curl
#   wget   pulls in openssl@3, which is a long build on this platform
#
# If you want them anyway:
#
#   brew "wget"
